```

# Conditions, loops and functions

```c
#include <stdio.h>

// A function that returns the larger of two numbers
int max(int a, int b) {
    return a > b ? a : b;
}

int main(void) {
    int marks = 58;

    if (marks >= 50) {
        printf("Pass\n");
    } else {
